{"task_id": "Mbpp/588", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\n\ndef big_diff(values: List[Union[int, float]]) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"Validate and return max(values) - min(values).\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: if values is empty\n        TypeError: if any element is not int or float\n    \"\"\"\n    if not values:\n        raise ValueError(\"values must contain at least one numeric element\")\n\n    for x in values:\n        if not isinstance(x, (int, float)):\n            raise TypeError(\"all elements must be int or float\")\n\n    return max(values) - min(values)"}
